SPARTA (24 Sep 2025)
Running on 1 MPI task(s)
################################################################################
# thermal gas in a 3d box with Lennard-Jones collision cross sections
# particles reflect off global box boundaries
#
# the cross section and alpha tables were computed from the Lennard-Jones
# 12-6 potential for argon, see ar.lj.vss
#
# Note:
#  - The "comm/sort” option to the “global” command is used to match MPI runs.
#  - The “twopass” option is used to match Kokkos runs.
# The "comm/sort" and "twopass" options should not be used for production runs.
################################################################################

seed	    	    12345
dimension   	    3
global              gridcut 1.0e-5 comm/sort yes

boundary	    rr rr rr

create_box  	    0 0.0001 0 0.0001 0 0.0001
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (0.0001 0.0001 0.0001)
create_grid 	    10 10 10
Created 1000 child grid cells
  CPU time = 0.000903845 secs
  create/ghost percent = 84.727 15.273

balance_grid        rcb part
Balance grid migrated 0 cells
  CPU time = 0.000157118 secs
  reassign/sort/migrate/ghost percent = 57.3596 0.60698 12.1396 29.8938

species		    ar.species Ar
mixture		    air Ar vstream 0.0 0.0 0.0 temp 273.15

global              nrho 7.07043E22
global              fnum 7.07043E6

collide		    table air ar.lj.vss linear 128
Tabulated cross section AR_AR_LJ from ar_lj.tab for Ar Ar:
  120 values, E = 0.0001 to 10 eV, max 4.733e-18, log-log interpolation
  2120 bins, 128 per factor of 2 in energy, reproduces input to 0.00154%
Tabulated alpha AR_AR_LJ_ALPHA from ar_lj.tab for Ar Ar:
  120 values, E = 0.0001 to 10 eV, max 1.921, log-log interpolation
  2120 bins, 128 per factor of 2 in energy, reproduces input to 0.00423%

create_particles    air n 10000 twopass
Created 10000 particles
  CPU time = 0.00195789 secs

stats		    100
compute             temp temp
stats_style	    step cpu np nattempt ncoll c_temp

timestep 	    7.00E-9
run 		    1000
